- discriminant: textSection
  value:
    title: 'Accounting that lives in your Odoo'
    number: '01'
    content: '<p>At Agitech we implement Odoo: accounting, invoicing, purchasing, inventory. To keep the numbers accurate day to day, we work with <a href="https://www.agifid.be/a-propos.html">AgiFid, a certified accounting firm and ITAA member</a> dedicated to companies run on Odoo.</p><ul><li>Your accountant works directly in your Odoo: no double entry, no files going back and forth</li><li>VAT, closings and tax prepared as you go, not once a year</li><li>Real-time dashboards and indicators</li><li>Fixed, transparent pricing</li></ul>'
    emphasis: false
- discriminant: textSection
  value:
    title: 'An integrator and an accountant, one tool'
    number: '02'
    content: '<p>Agitech (Odoo Silver partner) and AgiFid are legally and operationally independent entities that work closely together: the integrator manages Odoo, the accountant manages accounting and tax. No more passing the buck between the IT provider and the accounting firm.</p><p>To learn more about the accounting side, discover <a href="https://www.agifid.be/index-en.html">AgiFid''s accounting firm offer for Odoo</a>.</p>'
    emphasis: false
